  "title": "AFP Spotlight: Use ENC_BOM",
  "description": "AFP Spotlight has UTF-16 strings that are expected to start with a\nByte Order Mark but do not always have one (and fall back to\nBig Endian if it's not there.) ENC_BOM was added in the 4.2 release\ncycle to address such a case. Use it instead of a custom function\ninside the dissector.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
